    "updated_at": "2023-01-27T00:57:53Z",
    "body": "Did you read the changes made in that PR? They are about when to update the content of the placeholder canvas, so that it happens in the OffscreenCanvas's scope's \"update the rendering\" step. That concerns the placeholder canvas, the one that stays in the main thread.   \r\nMy proposed change doesn't affect much of your concerns, this PR already asks that this content be updated in this \"update the rendering\" step. If you think this is bad, then we have a bigger issue.",
